        "4737 - وَ قَالَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: \"مَاتَ إِبْرَاهِيمُ وَ لَهُ ثَمَانِيَةَ عَشَرَ شَهْراً فَأَتَمَّ اَللَّهُ رَضَاعَهُ فِي اَلْجَنَّةِ \"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4737 - Imam (as) said: \"Ibrahim (the son of the Prophet) died at the age of eighteen months, and Allah (swt) completed his breastfeeding in Paradise.\""
        ]
      }
